    "text": "Let the equation of the plane, that passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and contains the line of intersection of the planes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math> is equal to :",
